<description>&lt;p&gt;Cameroon’s BIR rapid-intervention force has been expanded around Lake Chad while drones and joint border patrols continue targeting Anglophone separatists in the Northwest and Southwest, where attacks on government forces persist. Government troops killed four suspected separatists after a deadly village attack. The government also suspended Issa Tchiroma’s political party for three months. The conflict caused 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE9aQk93bFoyVWxyWll2c1BHbE9EcWZVVmFfLXl6YndkMHljeF82Si1qeUhpSmI4cWVaUFpzXzN0cHRyWmJUMmFFRTBMdGVXYjJKaVMxcW1UN2RKYzQ4TUpyVTdLRTlHaTNFNEJ4X0VHdDFKSnJwUUR3?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sportstar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOVUhXakozcDRGZUZROE5TWEVwbzM2dWJUbmlkSWRsNlZNYXN0T3MyYjh6cElEc0MxTHE0VlFIb0FsOEFOcWF6N2tJS0lXWVlVYW1GT1FxY1o3czdMVWp2Qmpvc0VKdUZ2M1pZVEZaeGphU21obmRlNlFOX0JhSVVJN2owVFk1RExwLUpxXzV5YkVsUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News &amp;amp; Headlines – Australian Broadcasting Corporation&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNWVFseFNXLWh5OTBqRUFFYXpJVy1SZFB1UnRfQ01McjRycVhWZVdabjJvMUVZNzBTb3FaS2F3Vm5pbHRqMXhJT3BpSXpINm92c2w5aXNCOWtFMENqSm9fcDB6VUVIUkpLNlNWOFN6S09EamFKcEh5WHg5YVRpZ0ZKVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Erasing 76 Crimes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOZjZJRHY2eWZRanBCZFFsVS10N3Q5SEIweUpsS0E1N0djYjFSMW9YOG9CazVSVUQ5bF9aTGdHYXRvWXNOOFFjTEIxcVVhMTVDU2p4MnlNbW0zZlplTnJKTGlfXzNnX2pIeXk3amFxdjFsWmZIZkVJNnFhMm5DMVZiT0YyTTYwQnBPMWh6SlJmTU0wTDV4QUttaFlaS28?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQSEEzWnVwV2VHeWFFdEp6OTVIdVp